 world of healing with Inu Atsume VR!\n\nInteract with 18 adorable dogs\u2014pet, play, and take photos in immersive VR & MR.\nBuild bonds with treats and toys, join contests, and fill your Dog Encyclopedia. With MR mode, your dogs appear in your real room\u2014chasing balls or resting by your side.\n\nPerfect for dog lovers seeking comfort, joy, and the ultimate pet-life experience!\n\n\u25bcRecommended For\n- Those who love dogs but can't have one in real life\n- Anyone seeking pure relaxation and healing\n- Players who want to experience the seamless fusion of reality and virtual life through MR\n{814438044505789}\n{1139162151516569}\n{1160254606204647}\n{1114335210875158}\n{1366656661550886}", "short_description": " A Must-Play for Dog Lovers! The Ultimate Healing Experience in VR & MR!\n\nInteract with 18 adorable dogs\u2014pet, play, and take photos in immersive VR & MR.\nBuild bonds with treats and toys, join contests, and fill your Dog Encyclopedia. With MR mode, your dogs appear in your real room\u2014chasing balls or resting by your side.\n\nPerfect for dog lovers seeking comfort, joy, and the ultimate pet-life experience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hit-point.co.jp/games/inuatsume_vr/privacypolicy_en.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hit-Point Co.,Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hit-point.co.jp/games/inuatsume_vr/index_en.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["